[clarity]  10.3 min  WREN: Something green is waking out there. Plant the first seed.
[clarity]  10.3 min  WREN: Lumi. I'm getting a signal. Green, faint, east of the hub. An old greenhouse. Go look.
[clarity]  10.4 min  WREN: Wait. Hold it up to the light.
[clarity]  10.4 min  card: Plant the first seed | Plants fill your Bloom Core.
[clarity]  10.4 min  beam: site 0 (31, 1)
[clarity]  10.4 min  WREN: That's a Settler seed tin. Cradle stamp on the lid. One of ours, left behind in the rush.
[clarity]  10.5 min  card: Plant the first seed
[clarity]  10.5 min  WREN: When they left, the Settlers sealed every seed they could carry into the Cradle's vault. Your vault, Lumi.
[clarity]  10.6 min  cut(reward): The surge faded. You grabbed 2 pieces at triple value; they pay out when you bale.
[events] ended salvage_surge handled=true  The surge faded. You grabbed 2 pieces at triple value; they pay out when you bale.
[clarity]  10.6 min  WREN: The plan was simple. Wait for the dust to settle. Come home. Plant. They called that day the Greenfall.
[orbit-perf] process_ms avg=68.35 max=135.44 physics_ms avg=94.04 junk=9745 (near 1575 far 8317) junk_ms=0 mounds=0 landmarks=0 draw_calls=0 prims=0 streamer={"apply_us_max":4877,"apply_us_sum":21789,"build_us_max":1030837,"build_us_sum":4330770,"built":36,"chunk_tris":79546,"collide":2,"horizon_m":434.040358614153,"jobs":2,"lod0":7,"lod1":12,"lod2":0,"near":64,"pending":2,"shell_ms":210,"shell_tris":61440,"view_alt":2.20515415439945}
[clarity]  10.8 min  WREN: Then three hundred years went by, and the dust never settled. Until a seed-keeper fell out of the sky.
[clarity]  10.8 min  WREN: Nothing grows on its own anymore. The soil forgot how. Somebody has to put it in the ground.
[clarity]  10.9 min  WREN: That somebody is you. Small. Stubborn. Running on four percent. Perfect.
[clarity]  11.0 min  WREN: Find clean ground. Dig. Drop it in. Pat it down. And then — this part matters — water it.
